# Material table for the imported actor. roqsim_walker resolves textures from the
# *.walker.json, NOT from this file -- but trimesh needs the .mtl present to split the
# OBJ into per-material groups and key them by name (skin.add_skin matches on that).

newmtl FemaleVisitor-material
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.800000 0.800000 0.800000
d 1.000000
illum 2
